# Gate step 1128-4ffr — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# check-capability-row.sh tells a joining host to publish a row and says its
# verdicts never block work; publishing it made the corpus partial, so release
# preflight refused and the pre-push hook wedged EVERY push from that host.
# Obeying the guard was what broke the host that obeyed it.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking a pending capability row does not wedge the host that published it (1128-4ffr)"
STEP_SCRIPT="scripts/test-pending-capability-row-does-not-wedge.sh"
STEP_ERROR="publishing the capability row the guard asks for wedges that host's pushes again, or the pending-row allowance widened and now launders a malformed fragment (1128-4ffr) — see the verdict line above"
STEP_OK="Pending capability row check passed"
# ORDER 2251-iyiu — A COULD-NOT-RUN IS NOT A CODE RED. Arms 7-8 start a child
# run and wait for it to reach its hold before signalling it; under load the
# child can miss the 30 s window, and the fixture says so honestly
# ("8 passed, 0 failed, 1 could-not-run", exit 3). With no declaration the
# gate read exit 3 as a failure and evicted #1249 (5e60118f5) for it. Declared
# load-sensitive: the gate settles and runs it once more, and a second
# could-not-run is named flaky:<step>:<v1>,<v2> for the queue to re-queue,
# never violation:. The 30 s window (TILLANDSIAS_1320_HOLD_WAIT_DS=300) is
# KEPT: widening it would slow every healthy gate to cover a loaded one,
# and the retry already absorbs the loaded case. Pinned by
# scripts/lua/test-capability-row-could-not-run-is-not-a-code-red.lua.
STEP_HOST_STATE="load"
STEP_SECOND_REGIME="macneo 2026-09-22 darwin ok:   the tree is restored to ok:release-preflight"

# ORDER 2157-ginp: STEP_READS, the paths this step reads, RECORDED ONLY: never
# consulted by the class-selector skip (that is STEP_INPUTS, 2118-tnut). First
# cut: the step's own script plus every repo path it names literally.
STEP_READS="plan/index.d/** scripts/check-capability-row.sh scripts/plan-binary-probe.sh scripts/release-preflight.sh scripts/test-pending-capability-row-does-not-wedge.sh"
